<title>Kerfline: free vector drawing for makers</title>
<meta name="description" content="Kerfline is a free vector editor for makers and students. Design for laser cutters, vinyl and print in your browser. No install, no account, works offline.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Kerfline: draw it, cut it, free">
<meta property="og:description" content="Free vector editor for makers. Laser and vinyl ready, DXF export, works offline, saves to your own drive.">
